    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your girlfriend know (or not) about the culprit who ate her ice cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738050/extras/7cafeb43aaec2ab9ded889e236b75c9f.avif?t=1747164714\" width=300 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>La~ la~ la~ It's time to eat my ice cream~</i>\u00a0\ud83c\udf66</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >975 words, that's around 5-15 minutes playing time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 mode: decide in advance on\u00a0<strong>who</strong>\u00a0ate the ice cream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different endings for each mode: 4 endings in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 visible stats and 2 hidden stats: you can't always know what your girlfriend is thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to be truthful, or not. And get what you deserve, or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girlfriend! \ud83e\udd7a\ud83d\udc95\ud83c\udf80\ud83c\udf66</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story, art, programming:\u00a0Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bgm:\u00a0\u306a\u304b\u3088\u3057\u30af\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0 - \u84b2\u927e\u3055\u3061\u3053</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >proofreading:\u00a0ebi-hime\u00a0(thank you so much!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >programming extra help: an anonymous family member (thank you again!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2024, a micro Visual Novel jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your girlfriend know (or not) about the culprit who ate her ice cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738050/extras/7cafeb43aaec2ab9ded889e236b75c9f.avif?t=1747164714\" width=300 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>La~ la~ la~ It's time to eat my ice cream~</i>\u00a0\ud83c\udf66</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >975 words, that's around 5-15 minutes playing time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 mode: decide in advance on\u00a0<strong>who</strong>\u00a0ate the ice cream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different endings for each mode: 4 endings in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 visible stats and 2 hidden stats: you can't always know what your girlfriend is thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to be truthful, or not. And get what you deserve, or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girlfriend! \ud83e\udd7a\ud83d\udc95\ud83c\udf80\ud83c\udf66</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story, art, programming:\u00a0Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bgm:\u00a0\u306a\u304b\u3088\u3057\u30af\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0 - \u84b2\u927e\u3055\u3061\u3053</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >proofreading:\u00a0ebi-hime\u00a0(thank you so much!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >programming extra help: an anonymous family member (thank you again!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2024, a micro Visual Novel jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.</p>",
